      "company_name": "MongoDB",
      "first_published": "2026-09-24T14:25:42-04:00",
      "language": "en",
      "application_deadline": null,
      "content": "&lt;p&gt;Join Cluster Scalability, one of MongoDB&#39;s Online Transaction Processing teams, and help build the core infrastructure that makes MongoDB a world-class distributed database. The team builds the infrastructure and tools that let customers scale their workloads past what a single node can handle. We take pride in building clean abstractions over hard distributed systems problems, so users can focus on their data instead of worrying about where it lives or how it&#39;s accessed. Our work has a big impact: it solves the hardest data challenges faced by MongoDB&#39;s largest customers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;[…]&lt;/p&gt;",
